{
  "openapi": "3.0.1",
  "info": {
    "title": "Dispatch Load Balancer API",
    "description": "Assigns delivery orders to a fleet of vehicles respecting **capacity** and **priority** (HIGH, MEDIUM, LOW) while minimizing travel distance (Haversine).\n\n**Typical flow:** 1) `POST /orders`  2) `POST /vehicles`  3) `GET /plan` (or `POST /plans` to save it, then `GET /plans/{id}/summary` for KPIs).\n\nOrders that cannot be placed are returned in `unassignedOrders` with a reason. Every path is also served under the assignment's original `/api/dispatch` prefix. Responses carry an `X-Correlation-Id` header that also appears in error bodies.",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://dispatch-load-balancer-q6wh.onrender.com",
      "description": "Generated server url"
    }
  ],
